<title>USA: MIAMI BEACH, FLA., DEAL REPRICED, COUPONS ADJUSTED.</title>
<headline>MIAMI BEACH, FLA., DEAL REPRICED, COUPONS ADJUSTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter said Wednesday it repriced Miami Beach, Fla.'s $21 million parking revenue bond deal, adjusting coupons in several maturities but leaving the yields unchanged.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>CITY OF MIAMI BEACH, FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: $21,000,000*</p>
<p>PARKING REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1997</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE WRITTEN AWARD IS EXPECTED FRIDAY, AUGUST 15TH.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>FSA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 08/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 03/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 09/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>09/01/1999		   45M    4.00  %	  4.05</p>
<p>09/01/2000		   45M    4.20  %	100.00</p>
<p>09/01/2001		   45M    4.50  %	  4.30</p>
<p>09/01/2002		   50M    4.40  %	  4.45</p>
<p>09/01/2003		   50M    4.50  %	  4.55</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>09/01/2004		   50M    4.60  %	  4.60</p>
<p>09/01/2005		   50M    4.70  %	  4.70</p>
<p>09/01/2006		   60M    4.70  %	  4.75</p>
<p>09/01/2007		   60M    4.75  %	  4.85</p>
<p>09/01/2008		   60M    4.80  %	  4.95</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>09/01/2009		   70M    4.90  %	  5.05</p>
<p>09/01/2010		1,135M    5.00  %	  5.15</p>
<p>09/01/2015		6,630M    5.00  %	  5.40</p>
<p>09/01/2022	     12,650M    5.125 %	  5.50</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 09/01/2007    101.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 09/01/2008</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, August 15, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on August 28, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter</p>
<p>AIBC Municipal Securities</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>Raymond, James &amp; Associates, Inc.</p>
<p>--Reuters Municipal Bond Desk, 212-859-1650 No text received</p>
